  "releaseNotes": "pick: run the pick-buffer readback on the render thread (`RenderMarshal` → `RunRender`) instead of the Kestrel worker — fixes an `AccessViolation` in `vkCmdCopyImageToBuffer` when a click's `Download` raced the render loop's resolve/encode. Staged a GPU argmin snap shader (`PickArgmin`) for a future constant-size readback.\nmerged zero-copy shared-texture streaming (Windows D3D11 keyed-mutex transport) — orthogonal to picking.",
